(`git apply` from the tree root; the hunk offset differs per commit). It puts
the Fixed* schedules on the single-threaded executor, as AS-235 (163bf54) did on
main. It changes speed, not output: 147e95b built WITHOUT it reproduces the
committed bisect cells 400/400 on side_won.

